n the stories as both vampire and folk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/d3df7afca3658117bd6501abf171b6c0.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Replay levels with original <i>inverse mechanics</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/88bd9acf0b4f0eb42a3f6356c1a69b67.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Artwork and animation inspired by Slavic art and Monty Python-style absurdism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/8a664368fad146e9b9c1d6e2dd860b54.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inspired by real accounts of Slavic folklore, respectfully adapted in collaboration with cultural experts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/6ad4bacfbf1558743812d9e1e84aa219.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A narrative tone that balances dark humor with historical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/3a64531475218c0026772977a26d1994.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=